    },
    {
      "claim": "The urgency and willingness of Berlin restaurants to pay for a forecasting SaaS.",
      "why_unsupported": "The user brief explicitly states that urgency and willingness to pay have not been supplied. While regulatory pressure and sustainability trends from unverified sources suggest a need, the financial readiness and perceived urgency for a SaaS solution are not evidenced.",
      "needed_evidence": ["Market research on Berlin restaurant budget allocation for software", "Surveys on perceived urgency of waste reduction solutions among Berlin restaurateurs"]
    },
    {
      "claim": "Specific data inputs, forecast horizon, integration requirements, operating workflow, and differentiation of the proposed SaaS.",
      "why_unsupported": "The user brief states these aspects of the solution have not been supplied and must be researched or labeled as assumptions. No external evidence was provided to define these specifics for the proposed SaaS.",
